  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/armenian/phil#Phil.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "109e778c0af40d84",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 14,
      "text": "Grace to you and peace from God our Father and from the Lord Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/armenian/phil#Phil.1.19",
      "source_sha256": "c146fad5b4b2dcf6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "For I know that this will lead to my salvation through your prayers and the gifts of the Spirit of Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/armenian/phil#Phil.1.21",
      "source_sha256": "772363575d43aba5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "For to me, to live is Christ, and to die is gain."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/armenian/phil#Phil.1.28",
      "source_sha256": "71c76704a4d6a630",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "And do not be frightened in any way by your opponents. This is a sign of their destruction and of your salvation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/armenian/phil#Phil.2.2",
      "source_sha256": "615b5f4fd9d69a79",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "Make my joy complete: think alike, have the same love within you, and be united in spirit and purpose."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/armenian/phil#Phil.2.23",
      "source_sha256": "33b77fb24b19e728",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "So I hope to send him as soon as I am certain about my own situation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/armenian/phil#Phil.4.19",
      "source_sha256": "f27947b0ab49d5d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 6,
      "text": "And may my God meet all your needs according to his abundance in glory in Christ Jesus."
    }
  ]
}
